==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**10 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Two Can]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Dark Cyclone's 250% strength magnification may seem scary, but with the combination of its high knockback count and the fact that it could be permafrozen by [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], it really isn't too threatening. Using [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to prevent Two Can's [[Wave Attack]]s and [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] to deal with the Aku Gories, this stage becomes very straightforward. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] can help with speeding up the process of killing Dark Cyclone and taking down its support.

[[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]] performs well in this stage due to being able to dodge every trait present.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Mitama the Oracle]]: With her high Slow uptime and Wave Immunity, she can Slow the whole field with high uptime (80% for everything except for Aku Gory, which is 66%).
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Kasa Jizo]]: Jizo has Massive Damage VS Dark enemies, allowing him to plow through them quickly, especially if stacked. Just be careful of Two Can's waves, as he is not Wave Immune.

==Trivia==
*Pythagorean Tributary's Japanese name, Pitagora Suigen (ピタゴラ水源, "Pythagora Water Source"), may be a pun on Pitagora Suitchi (ピタゴラスイッチ, ''[[wikipedia:PythagoraSwitch|PythagoraSwitch]]'', an educational TV program). The [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]] in the stage might allude to ''PythagoraSwitch''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s "The Black Box Person Question" segment.

